"use": "a COMPACT air/naval base (user, 2026-09-28): gate + guardhouse on the +Z side (the gate road), HQ, barracks, parade ground, motor pool with trucks, fuel depot, armoury bunker, helipad, control tower, one fighter hangar (two jets) and an apron row (two jets) on the -X side where the runway (MilitaryAirfield) abuts, the pier (MilitaryPier) through the gap in the -Z fence. Everything within ~300 m. The HQ, barracks, armoury, hangar and control tower are walkable mission buildings (kits/interiors/Mil*.blend); the jets (FIJ1) and trucks (CRT1) are drivable parked vehicles. PLACEHOLDER (library_civic.py, kits/interiors)",
"wall_top_m": 0.0
}

